<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Shout</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Paladin (guild level 160)
Mana: 35
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy shout &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The strongest of the paladin's prayers against evil: the paladin shouts the 
liturgy of the gods and grasps the target. Any target whose alignment is below 0 can be struck, even a neutral who 
leans to evil, and is hurt hard; the truly evil are hurt more. On anyone of 
alignment 0 or above, nothing happens. The better your divine 
power and sphere, the more it hurts. It hurts most through clothes and least through 
plate, which takes about a third less, and since the paladin grasps the 
target, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight, but you can't cast it while 
fighting: it can only open one. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
